<BaseLayout title="National Snapshot - SDA Home Choices" description="Australia's SDA market reached 13,779 enrolled dwellings as at 31 March 2026, growing at an average of 13 new dwellings enrolled per week during Q3 2025-26.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="SDAHC Research"
    title="National Snapshot"
  />
  <section class="section"><div class="prose">
    <p>Australia's SDA market reached 13,779 enrolled dwellings as at 31 March 2026, growing at an average of 13 new dwellings enrolled per week during Q3 2025-26. High Physical Support remains the dominant design category, accounting for 49% of national supply.</p>

    <h2>Key market indicators</h2>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Enrolled SDA dwellings (national)</td><td>13,779</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Dwelling growth since Q4 2022-23</td><td>+74%</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Participants living in SDA</td><td>16,263</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Participants with SDA funding</td><td>25,633</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Participants not utilising SDA funding</td><td>9,370</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Active SDA providers</td><td>563</td></tr>
        <tr><td>High Physical Support share of supply</td><td>49%</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Enrolled dwellings by state and territory</h2>
    <p>Detailed analysis for each jurisdiction, including regional distribution, design category profile, supply pipeline and SIL ecosystem depth, is available on our individual state pages.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>State or territory</th><th>Enrolled dwellings</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-vic/">Victoria</a></td><td>4,013</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-nsw/">New South Wales</a></td><td>3,387</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-qld/">Queensland</a></td><td>2,875</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-sa/">South Australia</a></td><td>1,802</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-wa/">Western Australia</a></td><td>1,178</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-act/">Australian Capital Territory</a></td><td>211</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-tas/">Tasmania</a></td><td>176</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/research/sda-market-nt/">Northern Territory</a></td><td>137</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>National total</strong></td><td><strong>13,779</strong></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>Source: SDAHC Research, SDA Market Report 2026. Figures reflect the most recent available NDIS data as at Q3 2025-26. See our <a href="/research/research-methodology/">methodology and data sources</a>.</p>
    <p>For definitions, quarterly updates and the full set of national figures, see our <a href="/sda-statistics/">Australian SDA statistics</a> page.</p>
